<h2>Decide where feedback should be collected</h2>
<p>An in-app question after an action and a survey link sent to an email list reach different people at different moments. A switch should preserve the collection context you need, rather than simply reproduce the questions in another builder.</p>
<p>These six options cover contextual feedback, intentional form completion and broader survey programmes. The shortlist is based on current official product and pricing information checked on October 14, 2026. Recommendations are editorial inferences; no product trials, completion-rate experiments or customer outcomes are claimed.</p>
